  "body": "Tucked away on the rear portion of a cross-lease section, this site at 109a Brian Crescent, Stanmore Bay offers privacy, potential, and the perfect opportunity to create your dream home on the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nThe section comes with building drawings included, helping you fast-track your project and turn your vision into reality. Whether you're planning your forever home or a smart investment build, this property offers a blank canvas in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nRear cross-lease section - private and set back from the street half share of 997m2 more or less\r\n\r\nBuilding drawings included for your convenience\r\n\r\nDesirable Stanmore Bay address in a family-friendly community\r\n\r\nHandy to Stanmore Bay Beach, Leisure Centre, schools, shops, and transport\r\n\r\nEasy access to Orewa, Silverdale, and the motorway for commuters\r\n\r\nStanmore Bay is prized for its coastal lifestyle, community atmosphere, and convenience to all the Hibiscus Coast has to offer. Secure this opportunity now and design the home you've always wanted.\r\n\r\nContact Paul Bayer today for more details or to view the site.",
